<title>KYRGYZSTAN: Kyrgyz Dec inflation slows to 4.5 pct vs November.</title>
<headline>Kyrgyz Dec inflation slows to 4.5 pct vs November.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kyrgyzstan's monthly December inflation rate slowed to 4.5 percent from 6.6 percent in November, a report from the National Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    KYRGYZ CONSUMER PRICES     Dec '96     Nov '96     Dec '95</p>
<p>    month-on-month pct change    +4.5	  +6.6	  +3.4</p>
<p>Annual inflation was 35 percent, up from the initial official target of 32 percent and 31.2 percent in 1995.</p>
<p>--Olga Dzyubenko, Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
